#: lib/policy.py:1834
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Admin is allowed to read the privacyIDEA-internal attributes of a user "
"(e.g. fido2_user_id)."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອ່ານຄຳນິຍາມເຊີບເວີ privacyIDEA ທາງໄກ."

#: lib/policy.py:1839
