#: lib/eventhandler/federationhandler.py:77
msgid "The remote/child privacyIDEA Server."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ privacyIDEA ທາງໄກ/ລູກ."

#: lib/eventhandler/federationhandler.py:82
msgid "Change the realm name to a realm on the child privacyIDEA system."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ເລມໃຫ້ເປັນເລມໃນລະບົບ privacyIDEA ລູກ."

#: lib/eventhandler/federationhandler.py:88
msgid "Change the resolver name to a resolver on the child privacyIDEA system."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ຣີໂຊລເວີໃຫ້ເປັນຣີໂຊລເວີໃນລະບົບ privacyIDEA ລູກ."

#: lib/eventhandler/federationhandler.py:94
msgid ""
"Forward the client IP to the child privacyIDEA server. Otherwise this "
"server will be the client."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄອພີຂອງລູກຄ້າໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີ privacyIDEA ລູກ. "
"ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີບເວີນີ້ຈະກາຍເປັນລູກຄ້າເອງ."

#: lib/eventhandler/federationhandler.py:101
msgid ""
"Forward the authorization header. This allows to also forward request "
"like token- and system-requests."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງຕໍ່ສ່ວນຫົວ (header) ການອະນຸຍາດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍເຊັ່ນ ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໂທເຄັນ ແລະ ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍລະບົບ "
"ໄດ້ນຳ."

